WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.853
One attention head gives every neighbour a weight, then takes one weighted average.

00:00:06.900 --> 00:00:11.643
Now two heads, set by hand. Head one scores by distance: nearer scores higher.

00:00:13.400 --> 00:00:16.835
Head two scores by direction: highest for neighbours straight ahead.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:23.736
Each head takes its own softmax, then averages the same values: two different answers.

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:31.498
Lay the two averages side by side, then mix them with an output matrix: here, mean and difference.

00:00:33.800 --> 00:00:42.307
Mask tokens beyond the cutoff: score minus infinity. The exponential gives exactly zero weight, and the rest still sum to one.

00:00:43.900 --> 00:00:47.436
Every head gets the same mask; head two renormalizes too.

00:00:48.800 --> 00:00:55.421
Multi-head attention: several weighted averages, concatenated and mixed. A mask removes tokens exactly.
